HB0252 Wind tax exemption-repeal.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Johnson, Angelos, Banks, Brown, G,
Campbell, K, Guggenmos, Harshman, Hoeft, Knapp,
Locke, Lucas, Singh, Strock, Styvar and Wasserburger
and Senator(s) Brennan, Case, Hutchings and Pearson
AN ACT relating to the tax on production of energy from wind resources; repealing
the three (3) year tax exemption on wind energy production; specifying
applicability; and providing for an effective date.
